  notes: ATCC 1612 specifies sterile anaerobic 5% Na2CO3, adding 0.25 ml per 10 ml
    receiving medium to adjust that medium to pH 8.2. PERCENT preserves the unspecified
    basis without asserting w/v, w/w, g/L or molarity. Stock solvent identity and
    grade, preparation volume and gas, and starting carbonate hydrate are unspecified.
    Basal and Wolfe-table water do not establish this stock carrier. The main-medium
    80% N2 / 20% CO2 condition is not an explicit stock preparation recipe. This stock
    remains separate from the source-explicit 5% w/v DSMZ 135/339a preparation and
    pure sodium carbonate.
notes: ATCC 1612 specifies sterile anaerobic 5% Na2CO3, adding 0.25 ml per 10 ml receiving
